        "title": "Show HN: PicoMQ – Durable Streams over HTTP, on object storage",
        "link": "https://picomq.com/",
        "description": "<p>PicoMQ is a Rust server for Durable Streams, built on Object Store. Cheap, URL-addressable, granular streams (create/append/read/long-poll/SSE), with Pico Protocol or Durable Streams Protocol as the facade.<p>S3Stream is the stream storage primitive, used in AutoMQ, shipped as a Rust library. Coordination is a command log in Postgres.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49421806\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49421806</a></p>\n<p>Points: 93</p>\n<p># Comments: 18</p>",
